\ln{\\left(3 \\right)})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nWork where $3^{x} + 2>0$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 2 \\cdot 3^{x} \\left(3^{x} + 2\\right)^{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{2}{\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}}\\left(\\int u^{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int u^{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\frac{u^{3}}{3}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{2}{\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}}\\left(\\int u^{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{2}{\\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}}\\left(\\frac{u^{3}}{3}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{2 \\left(3^{x} + 2\\right)^{3}}{3 \\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "bfb8dc7a-8efe-5c10-8f98-d40a62827a4c" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "bfb8dc7a-8efe-5c10-8f98-d40a62827a4c" :question/answer-fields "5c568666-f41c-5477-be0f-bec79adf21c3"] [:db/ensure "bfb8dc7a-8efe-5c10-8f98-d40a62827a4c" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions "bfb8dc7a-8efe-5c10-8f98-d40a62827a4c"] [:db/add "6d2bea10-b41d-5d58-b32c-47deebda1403" :answer/id #uuid "6d2bea10-b41d-5d58-b32c-47deebda1403"] [:db/add "6d2bea10-b41d-5d58-b32c-47deebda1403" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "6d2bea10-b41d-5d58-b32c-47deebda1403" :answer/value "\\frac{2 \\left(\\frac{e^{2 x}}{2} + 1\\right)^{3}}{3}+C"] [:db/ensure "6d2bea10-b41d-5d58-b32c-47deebda1403" :answer/validate] [:db/add "7d9f7646-747c-5619-913c-0411ccf56249" :answer/id #uuid "7d9f7646-747c-5619-913c-0411ccf56249"] [:db/add "7d9f7646-747c-5619-913c-0411ccf56249" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "7d9f7646-747c-5619-913c-0411ccf56249" :answer/value "- \\frac{4 \\left(e^{2 x} + 2\\right)^{3}}{3}+C"] [:db/ensure "7d9f7646-747c-5619-913c-0411ccf56249" :answer/validate] [:db/add "284b327f-6f48-5ecb-8eb4-e2c368f0c8c5" :answer/id #uuid "284b327f-6f48-5ecb-8eb4-e2c368f0c8c5"] [:db/add "284b327f-6f48-5ecb-8eb4-e2c368f0c8c5" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "284b327f-6f48-5ecb-8eb4-e2c368f0c8c5" :answer