30d-9800-bd478ae2d890" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int 4 \\left(e^{2 x} + 2\\right)^{2} e^{2 x}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nWork where $e^{2 x} + 2>0$.\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "ae4bd4cd-5e1a-530d-9800-bd478ae2d890" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=e^{2 x} + 2$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(2 e^{2 x})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nWork where $e^{2 x} + 2>0$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 4 \\left(e^{2 x} + 2\\right)^{2} e^{2 x}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=2\\left(\\int u^{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int u^{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\frac{u^{3}}{3}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n2\\left(\\int u^{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=2\\left(\\frac{u^{3}}{3}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{2 \\left(e^{2 x} + 2\\right)^{3}}{3}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "ae4bd4cd-5e1a-530d-9800-bd478ae2d890" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "ae4bd4cd-5e1a-530d-9800-bd478ae2d890" :question/answer-fields "99572807-ec4d-5813-adf9-c6d7e6a2268f"] [:db/ensure "ae4bd4cd-5e1a-530d-9800-bd478ae2d890" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions "ae4bd4cd-5e1a-530d-9800-bd478ae2d890"] [:db/add "34ba3174-d278-556e-bae3-0129792545ed" :answer/id #uuid "34ba3174-d278-556e-bae3-0129792545ed"] [:db/add "34ba3174-d278-556e-bae3-0129792545ed" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "34ba3174-d278-556e-bae3-0129792545ed" :answer/value "2^{x} + 1+C"] [:db/ensure "34ba3174-d278-556e-bae3-0129792545ed" :answer/validate] [:db/add "158c887d-2a05-5e83-a9aa-f2adf65f80af" :answer/id #uuid "158c887d-2a05-5e83-a9aa-f2adf65f80af"] [:db/add "158c887d-2a05-5e83-a9aa-f2adf65f80af" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "158c887d-2a05-5e83-a9aa-f2adf65f80af" :answer/value "\\frac{3 \\left(2^{x} + 1\\right)^{4}}{4 \\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}+C"] [:db/ensure "158c887d-2a05-5e83-a9aa-f2adf65f80af" :answer/validate] [:db/add "86b40a74-a9d7-58a2-ac0b-f6