t "158c887d-2a05-5e83-a9aa-f2adf65f80af"] [:db/ensure "d1c8911f-8364-5b23-94ca-92daef001437" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "5e9c245f-c237-585a-b2f6-6b621446ab85" :question/id #uuid "5e9c245f-c237-585a-b2f6-6b621446ab85"] [:db/add "5e9c245f-c237-585a-b2f6-6b621446ab85" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int 3 \\cdot 2^{x} \\left(2^{x} + 1\\right)^{3}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nWork where $2^{x} + 1>0$.\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "5e9c245f-c237-585a-b2f6-6b621446ab85" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2^{x} + 1$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(2^{x} \\ln{\\left(2 \\right)})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nWork where $2^{x} + 1>0$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 3 \\cdot 2^{x} \\left(2^{x} + 1\\right)^{3}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{3}{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}\\left(\\int u^{3}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int u^{3}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\frac{u^{4}}{4}+C.\n$$\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}\\left(\\int u^{3}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{3}{\\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}\\left(\\frac{u^{4}}{4}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{3 \\left(2^{x} + 1\\right)^{4}}{4 \\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "5e9c245f-c237-585a-b2f6-6b621446ab85" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "5e9c245f-c237-585a-b2f6-6b621446ab85" :question/answer-fields "d1c8911f-8364-5b23-94ca-92daef001437"] [:db/ensure "5e9c245f-c237-585a-b2f6-6b621446ab85" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions "5e9c245f-c237-585a-b2f6-6b621446ab85"] [:db/add "2ae4c1d8-05e1-5413-8181-2be437299426" :answer/id #uuid "2ae4c1d8-05e1-5413-8181-2be437299426"] [:db/add "2ae4c1d8-05e1-5413-8181-2be437299426" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "2ae4c1d8-05e1-5413-8181-2be437299426" :answer/value "\\frac{3 \\left(e^{2 x} + 4\\right)^{4}}{8}+C"] [:db/ensure "2ae4c1d8-05e1-5413-8181-2be437299426" :answer/validate]